        "file": "scripts/screenshots/autotest-results.html",
        "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=1200\">\n  <title>NetScan Canon — AutoTest screenshot</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../public/style.css\">\n  <style>\n    html, body { margin: 0; background: #08090d; min-height: 100%; }\n    body { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; padding: 20px; }\n    .shot-wrap { width: 1080px; }\n    .ad-modal-backdrop { position: static !important; display: flex !important; opacity: 1 !important; visibility: visible !important; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.55); padding: 0; inset: auto; }\n    .ad-modal-backdrop.hidden { display: flex !important; }\n    .autotest-modal.ad-modal { width: 1080px; max-width: 1080px; height: 820px; max-height: 820px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin: 0; }\n    .autotest-run-scroll { flex: 1 1 0%; overflow: hidden; max-height: 420px; }\n    .hidden { display: none !important; }\n    details.autotest-remote-help[open] summary ~ * { display: block; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"shot-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"ad-modal-backdrop autotest-modal-backdrop\">\n      <div class=\"ad-modal autotest-modal autotest-themed-modal glass-panel\">\n        <div class=\"modal-sticky-head\">\n          <header class=\"ad-modal-header\">\n            <div class=\"ad-modal-brand\">\n              <div class=\"ad-modal-icon autotest-modal-icon\">🔗</div>\n              <div class=\"ad-modal-heading\">\n                <h2>AutoTest de Rede</h2>\n                <p class=\"ad-modal-subtitle\">Gateway · DNS · Ping · TCP · Traceroute · Switch LLDP/CDP</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"ad-modal-close\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</button>\n          </header>\n          <nav class=\"ad-modal-tabs modal-sticky-tabs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"autotest-tab ad-tab active\">AutoTest</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"autotest-tab ad-tab\">Switch</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"autotest-tab ad-tab\">Histórico</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"autotest-tab ad-tab\">Config</button></nav>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ad-modal-body modal-sticky-body autotest-modal-body\">\n    <section class=\"ad-tab-panel autotest-run-panel\">\n      \n    <div class=\"ad-toolbar-card\">\n      <div class=\"ad-toolbar-row ad-toolbar-row-primary autotest-run-toolbar\">\n        <label class=\"ad-field autotest-profile-field\"><span class=\"ad-field-label\">Perfil</span>\n          <select class=\"ad-input ad-select\"><option>Escritório</option></select></label>\n        <label class=\"ad-field autotest-nic-field\"><span class=\"ad-field-label\">Placa</span>\n          <select class=\"ad-input ad-select\"><option>Primária</option></select></label>\n        <div class=\"ad-toolbar-actions autotest-run-actions\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-tertiary btn-sm\">Personalizar</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Executar AutoTest</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Executar remoto</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-tertiary btn-sm\">Exportar PDF</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-tertiary btn-sm\">Exportar CSV</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"autotest-remote-bar\">\n        <label class=\"ad-field autotest-remote-agent-field\"><span class=\"ad-field-label\">Estação remota</span>\n          <input class=\"ad-input\" value=\"WS-SALA-042\" readonly></label>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-tertiary btn-sm\">Atualizar agentes</button>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"autotest-remote-help\">\n        <summary>Passo 1 — instalar agente na estação (automático, estilo Veyon)</summary>\n        <p class=\"ad-section-hint\">Instala <strong>uma vez</strong> como serviço Windows — sobe com o PC, <strong>sem Node aberto</strong>.</p>\n        <div class=\"autotest-pairing-row\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Gerar código de pareamento</button>\n          <span class=\"autotest-pairing-code\">A7K9-2M4X</span>\n        </div>\n        <pre class=\"autotest-remote-cmd\">.\\scripts\\install-autotest-agent-service.ps1 -ServerUrl \"http://10.50.12.5:3000\" -PairingCode \"A7K9-2M4X\"</pre>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n      <div class=\"autotest-run-scroll\">\n        <div class=\"autotest-local-chips\">\n          <span class=\"autotest-eng-tag\">Ethernet · 10.50.12.88</span>\n          <span class=\"autotest-eng-tag\">GW 10.50.12.1 · 1000 Mbps</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"autotest-results-section\">\n          <header class=\"autotest-section-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"autotest-section-title\">Resultados · L2 / L3 / L4</h3>\n            <p class=\"autotest-section-sub\">Passos executados na interface selecionada</p>\n          </header>\n          <div class=\"ad-scroll-panel autotest-steps-panel\">\n            <div class=\"autotest-steps-grid\">\n    <article class=\"autotest-step-card autotest-step-card-eng autotest-step-pass\">\n      <header class=\"autotest-step-head\">\n        <span class=\"autotest-step-badge autotest-step-badge-pass\">OK</span>\n        <h4 class=\"autotest-step-label\">Interface de rede</h4>\n        <span class=\"autotest-step-ms\">12 ms</span>\n      </header>\n      <div class=\"autotest-step-body\">\n        <p class=\"autotest-step-detail\">Ethernet ativa · 1000 Mbps full-duplex</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"autotest-step-card autotest-step-card-eng autotest-step-pass\">\n      <header class=\"autotest-step-head\">\n        <span class=\"autotest-step-badge autotest-step-badge-pass\">OK</span>\n        <h4 class=\"autotest-step-label\">Endereço IPv4</h4>\n        <span class=\"autotest-step-ms\">8 ms</span>\n      </header>\n      <div class=\"autotest-step-body\">\n        <p class=\"autotest-step-detail\">10.50.12.88 /24 · DHCP</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"autotest-step-card autotest-step-card-eng autotest-step-pass\">\n      <header class=\"autotest-step-head\">\n        <span class=\"autotest-step-badge autotest-step-badge-pass\">OK</span>\n        <h4 class=\"autotest-step-label\">Gateway padrão</h4>\n        <span class=\"autotest-step-ms\">24 ms</span>\n      </header>\n      <div class=\"autotest-step-body\">\n        <p class=\"autotest-step-detail\">10.50.12.1 respondeu em 2 ms</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"autotest-step-card autotest-step-card-eng autotest-step-pass\">\n      <header class=\"autotest-step-head\">\n        <span class=\"autotest-step-badge autotest-step-badge-pass\">OK</span>\n        <h4 class=\"autotest-step-label\">VLAN 802.1Q</h4>\n        <span class=\"autotest-step-ms\">6 ms</span>\n      </header>\n      <div class=\"autotest-step-body\">\n        <p class=\"autotest-step-detail\">Sem tag · access port</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <arti\n\n/* … truncado na árvore (arquivo completo no GitHub) … */\n",
