        "id": "customize-veyon-file-3rdparty-libvncserver-github-issue-template-bug-report-md",
        "parent": "customize-veyon-dir-3rdparty-libvncserver-github-issue-template",
        "layer": "file",
        "title": "bug_report.md",
        "description": "Código-fonte: `3rdparty/libvncserver/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.md`",
        "file": "3rdparty/libvncserver/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.md",
        "code": "---\r\nname: Bug report\r\nabout: Create a report to help us improve\r\ntitle: ''\r\nlabels: bug\r\nassignees: ''\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIf you'd like to put out an incentive for fixing this bug, you can do so at https://issuehunt.io/r/LibVNC/libvncserver\r\n\r\n**Describe the bug**\r\n<!-- A clear and concise description of what the bug is. -->\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n<!-- Steps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Done this.\r\n2. Done that.\r\n3. Done nothing. \r\n-->\r\n\r\n**Expected Behavior**\r\n<!-- A clear and concise description of what you expected to happen. -->\r\n\r\n**Logs/Backtraces**\r\n<!-- If applicable, add log output and/or debugger backtraces to help explain your problem. -->\r\n\r\n**Your environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - OS and version:\r\n - Compiler and version: \r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n<!-- Add any other context about the problem here. -->\r\n",
