        "title": "minmax.h",
        "description": "Código-fonte: `3rdparty/ultravnc/winvnc/winvnc/minmax.h`",
        "file": "3rdparty/ultravnc/winvnc/winvnc/minmax.h",
        "code": "// This file is part of UltraVNC\r\n// https://github.com/ultravnc/UltraVNC\r\n// https://uvnc.com/\r\n//\r\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later\r\n//\r\n// SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright (C) 2002-2025 UltraVNC Team Members. All Rights Reserved.\r\n// SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright (C) 1999-2002 Vdacc-VNC & eSVNC Projects. All Rights Reserved.\r\n// SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright (C) 1999 AT&T Laboratories Cambridge. All Rights Reserved.\r\n//\r\n\r\n\r\n// Routines to calculate the maximum and minimum of two integers\r\n\r\n#if !defined(MINMAX_INCLUDED)\r\n#define MINMAX_INCLUDED\r\n#pragma once\r\n\r\n// Some routines used internally to minimise and maximise integers\r\nstatic inline int Max(int x, int y)\r\n{\r\n\tif (x>y)\r\n\t\treturn x;\r\n\telse\r\n\t\treturn y;\r\n}\r\n\r\nstatic inline int Min(int x, int y)\r\n{\r\n\tif (x>y)\r\n\t\treturn y;\r\n\telse\r\n\t\treturn x;\r\n}\r\n\r\n#endif",
