        "code": "/** Tamanho inicial dos cards no mapa (devices e departamentos). */\nexport const MAP_CARD_WIDTH = 168;\nexport const MAP_CARD_HEIGHT = 96;\n\nexport const MAP_CARD_NODE_STYLE = {\n  width: MAP_CARD_WIDTH,\n  height: MAP_CARD_HEIGHT,\n} as const;\n\n/** Props de dimensão para nós React Flow v12 (measured usa offsetWidth/Height do wrapper). */\nexport const MAP_CARD_NODE_DIMS = {\n  width: MAP_CARD_WIDTH,\n  height: MAP_CARD_HEIGHT,\n  initialWidth: MAP_CARD_WIDTH,\n  initialHeight: MAP_CARD_HEIGHT,\n  style: { ...MAP_CARD_NODE_STYLE },\n} as const;\n",
